    "description": "Not harsh parenting…\nbut over-helping, over-protecting, over-controlling.\n\nThat’s how confidence quietly breaks.\n\nIt doesn’t happen in one moment.\nIt happens in small, loving actions repeated daily:\n\nDoing it for them.\nFixing it too fast.\nNot letting them feel.\nNot letting them try.\n\nAnd slowly…\nthey stop trusting themselves.\n\nIf this made you pause,\nyou’re already becoming a more aware parent.\n\nComment “STRENGTH” and I’ll share simple shifts\nto raise mentally strong, self-trusting kids.\n\n#parenting #parentingtips #mindfulparenting #gentleparenting #raisingkids",
